<title>USA: Citicorp stock gains on larger stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Citicorp stock gains on larger stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of Citicorp jumped Tuesday after the bank's board expanded its stock repurchase programme by $4 billion to $8.5 billion.</p>
<p>Citicorp was up $1.375 to $106.50 in late afternoon trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company said the stock buyback will run through Dec. 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Citicorp had an average of 485.6 million shares outstanding in the third quarter.</p>
